Title: BIRTH LOCKET
Author: ScriptLens Demo
Draft date: August 2026

FADE IN:

EXT. BACKYARD - DAY

It is 10:00 AM.

EMMA, a slight woman—a literal pocket rocket—stands under the blazing sun. Sweat drips down her neck, pooling at her clavicle where a GOLD LOCKET rests in the salty moisture.

Her husband, JOSH, stands a few feet away. He is visibly growing more scared by the second, but also increasingly in awe.

Emma is in a state of violent animation. Her nostrils flare. She turns to the sky, to the world, to the day, to Josh.

She BELLOWS an expletive at the top of her lungs. It is an absolutely magnificent swear. The volume gives it a devastating impact.

EMMA
(bellowing)
F---! F--- the world! F--- this day!

Emma lunges forward and GRIPS Josh's hand. She pulls with such primal, savage force that Josh winces, his shoulder tensing as if his arm might rip completely out of the socket.

EMMA (CONT'D)
(roaring)
AAAAARRRRRGGGGHH!!

A glorious, guttural sound rips forcibly from Emma's throat. She is completely primal now, letting her base instincts take over. Who needs words?

She pulls him hard, dragging him toward the open backdoor of the house.

EMMA (CONT'D)
Through! We have to go through!

INT. BEDROOM - CONTINUOUS

Emma collapses onto the edge of the bed, dragging Josh down with her. She kicks her legs out, throwing her head back in absolute, positive madness.

EMMA
(screaming)
Who does this willingly?! There is no sense in this!

A MIDWIFE steps into the frame, completely calm, holding a clean WHITE TOWEL.

MIDWIFE
Push, Emma! Just one more!

Emma lets out one final, animalistic roar that shakes the window panes.

A sharp, sudden cry cuts through the room. The midwife smiles, holding up a tiny, wet, squirming infant.

MIDWIFE (CONT'D)
It's a girl!

Emma collapses back against the pillows, panting, a triumphant, exhausted smile breaking across her face.

FADE OUT.

THE END
